        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Door Closer Drop Plate</b>\r\n<p>\r\nUse on doors with narrow top door frames and doors with glass, when the glass interferes with closer mounting. Often used on metal framed glass store front doors. Also used to lower a door closer up to 1-1/2\".  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with Global Door Controls <a href=\"/products/tc201ada-global-grade-1-ada-compliant-surface-mount-door-closer\"><b>TC201ADA</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/tc201-global-grade-1-surface-mount-door-closer\"><b>TC200 series</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/surface-mounted-ada-compliant-door-closer-global-tc2201ada\"><b>TC2201ADA</b></a>. \r\n<a href=\"/products/light-commercial-surface-mount-closer-pdq-3100-bcpa\"><b>American Eagle 3100</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/light-commercial-ada-compliant-surface-mount-closer-pdq-3101-bcpa\"><b>American Eagle 3100 ADA</b></a> or any door closer with a <b>common 9-1/6\u001d\" x 3/4\" \u001d mounting hole pattern</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DP-1214-dimensions.jpg?v=1704354741\" width=\"600\" height=\"225\" border=\"0\" alt=\"drop plate dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Global DP-1214 Drop Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 9-1/6\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with installation screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually.</b></p>",
